TASK: Redesign and restructure Writing Mode on iOS into a clean chat-based writing experience.

CURRENT PROBLEM:
The current Writing Mode screen is too complex and crowded.
It currently looks like a dashboard with:
- large Writing Mode title
- long description
- oversized prompt box
- writing category cards
- Personal Writing Style card
- multiple large sections

This makes the screen feel cluttered and unlike the rest of BlueMind.

GOAL:
Writing Mode should feel like a NORMAL BlueMind chat screen, but with specialized writing capabilities.

Think:
“Normal Chat + Writing Intelligence”

Do NOT make it look like a dashboard.

